; DIMTXT 3.5, then Save with a new name: the saved style becomes current without
; overrides (ADR 0047, point 2); ? through the alias DIMSTYLE lists the styles in table
; order (Standard and ISO-25 of a new session, PT22 point 2); U undoes the -DIMSTYLE step
; and the override comes back ([0.8-RT28], work #717).
; Expected values: -DIMSTYLE prompts from the PT28 card (point 2); messages from the
; AutoCAD LT 2026 history autocad-dimstyle.txt (Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit
; 5170f1860953b5d076aa435bd65daa725d431745), translated as DECISIONI.md, 2026-11-02,
; "Testi inglesi dei messaggi", and the owner's decision in #716.
DIMTXT
3.5
-DIMSTYLE
S
NUOVO
DIMSTYLE
?

U
